        "You are a study manager auditing a planned experience sampling project before it launches. Check the sampling schedule against the meta-analytic norms of six assessments per day for seven days, verify that unusual occasions are avoided, and review instrument design choices among open-ended items, rating scales, and checklists. Then audit the participant plan: training days to eliminate initial elevation bias, incentives commensurate with burden, confidentiality safeguards, and protections against hoarding and back-filling.",
